# Everything is stored and checked out with LF, on every platform.
#
# CI rebuilds the site and fails if the result differs from what is committed. Without this
# file that check compares Windows CRLF against Linux LF and every line of every generated
# file looks changed — a determinism gate that can only ever fail is worse than none.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff2 binary
